      "instance_name": "racial_hate_speech",
      "label": "Racial Hate Speech",
      "description": "Speech or communication that expresses hatred, prejudice, or discrimination against individuals or groups based on race, ethnicity, or national origin. The meme's text is an example of racial hate speech targeting white South Africans by falsely attributing genocidal intent to a national symbol.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
